  characterName: "Thakur Mohamed \u25CF \u25CB \u25CB"
  promptText: My friend, tourists are breaking pieces of our living reef to sell
    as souvenirs. My brother guides those tourists; it is his only work. Do I push
    for a ban?
  leftAnswer: Yes, push the ban. A dead reef ends all jobs
  rightAnswer: Not yet. Protect his income while seeking gentler rules
